{"pageid":3408,"title":"Zombie","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Zombie</span>","revid":15346,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-Character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Zombie</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"appearsin\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Appears in</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Blood Moons</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\nThe <b>Zombie</b> is an enemy added in the Halloween 2024 event. The <b>Zombie</b> can appear during a <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\">Blood Moon</a>, which last 5 in-game hours or 5 minutes in real life. When killed, it drops 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Bone\" title=\"Bone\">Bone</a>, 1-3 <a href=\"/wiki/Candycorn\" title=\"Candycorn\">Candycorn</a>, and has a 30-50% chance to drop a <a href=\"/wiki/Zombie_Head\" title=\"Zombie Head\">Zombie Head</a>. If a <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Zombie</strong> is wearing a <a href=\"/wiki/Pumpkin\" title=\"Pumpkin\">Pumpkin</a>, it will drop upon death.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>It can spawn in the center of the Farlands (near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lighthouse\" title=\"Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>), the Taiga (behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's Autologistics</a>) and in the Savannah.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163815\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor